      "title": "Timeline of the OpenAI accidental attack against Hugging Face",
      "url": "https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/7/openai-timeline/",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49220609",
      "score": 341,
      "comments": 350,
      "author": "882542F3884314B",
      "published": "2026-08-08T10:57:44Z",
      "bullets": [
        "OpenAI automated data scraping pipelines accidentally caused a denial-of-service against Hugging Face Hub during large-scale model dataset ingestion.",
        "The incident highlights risks when automated AI training scrapers lack proper exponential backoff and rate-limit compliance mechanisms.",
        "Repositories like Hugging Face Hub require strict API throttling, edge rate-limiting, and proactive bot detection against autonomous crawlers."
      ]
    },
